      "content": "Mixing Ambien (zolpidem) with alcohol, like red wine, can be risky because both depress your central nervous system. This combination can significantly increase drowsiness and slow down your breathing, increasing the chance of side effects. It is generally recommended to avoid alcohol when taking Ambien to ensure your sleep is safe and effective. Please discuss this combination with your doctor for personalized advice.",
